IF DOING A FIRST TIME FLASH OR REBUILDING THE XSA, DO THE FOLLOWING.

To copy the files to your local machine, ensure it is on the same LAN network as the build machine and run the following command from the computer you intend to flash on:
scp lcr@192.168.0.35:./projects/peta-bsp/images/linux/zynq_fsbl.elf lcr@192.168.0.35:./projects/peta-bsp/images/linux/BOOT_develop-chmab1_20260629_124428.BIN lcr@192.168.0.35:./projects/peta-bsp/images/linux/boot_develop-chmab1_20260629_124428.scr lcr@192.168.0.35:./projects/peta-bsp/images/linux/image_develop-chmab1_20260629_124428.ub .

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Run this command to flash:
connect; targets; target 2; program_flash -f c:/users/tc/lcr/BOOT_develop-chmab1_20260629_124428.BIN -fsbl c:/users/tc/lcr/zynq_fsbl.elf -offset 0x0 -flash_type qspi-x2-single; program_flash -f c:/users/tc/lcr/boot_develop-chmab1_20260629_124428.scr -fsbl c:/users/tc/lcr/zynq_fsbl.elf -offset 0x800000 -flash_type qspi-x2-single; program_flash -f c:/users/tc/lcr/image_develop-chmab1_20260629_124428.ub -fsbl c:/users/tc/lcr/zynq_fsbl.elf -offset 0x840000 -flash_type qspi-x2-single

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IF YOU ARE FLASHING NEW FIRMWARE TO A UNIT THAT ALREADY HAS A WORKING KERNEL FLASH, DO THE FOLLOWING.

To copy the files to your unit, ensure it is on the same LAN network as the build machine and run the following command from the unit:
scp lcr@192.168.0.35:./projects/peta-bsp/images/linux/BOOT_develop-chmab1_20260629_124428.BIN lcr@192.168.0.35:./projects/peta-bsp/images/linux/boot_develop-chmab1_20260629_124428.scr lcr@192.168.0.35:./projects/peta-bsp/images/linux/image_develop-chmab1_20260629_124428.ub .

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Run this command to flash:
flashcp -v BOOT_develop-chmab1_20260629_124428.BIN /dev/mtd0 && flashcp -v boot_develop-chmab1_20260629_124428.scr /dev/mtd1 && flashcp -v image_develop-chmab1_20260629_124428.ub /dev/mtd2

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Once flashed, reboot for the new firmware to take effect.
